    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問　円運動する音源のドップラー効果（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "まずここを確認",
            "text": "聞こえた時刻は、音源がその音を出した時刻と、そこから点Pまで音が進む時間の和です。ドップラー効果の式だけでなく、伝播時間も別に書きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　最も高い音を出す位置と初回通過時刻",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点Pへ向かう速度成分が最大になるのは、速度の向きが直線BPと一致するときです。円の接線は半径OBと直交するため、三角形OBPから中心角を求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q1-tangent-geometry",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\angle POB=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\,[\\mathrm{rad}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "音源は時刻0に点Aを通過し、反時計回りに進みます。初めて点Bへ行くまでの回転角は \\(2\\pi-\\pi/3\\) です。角速度で割れば時刻になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t_1=\\frac{2\\pi-\\pi/3}{\\omega}=\\frac{5\\pi}{3\\omega}\\,[\\mathrm{s}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　最高・最低の観測振動数",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "音源の速さは \\(r\\omega\\) です。近づくときは分母が \\(V-r\\omega\\)、遠ざかるときは \\(V+r\\omega\\) になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f_{\\max}=\\frac{V}{V-r\\omega}f_0,\\qquad f_{\\min}=\\frac{V}{V+r\\omega}f_0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　最低音から次の最高音まで",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点Cと点Bはどちらも点Pまでの距離が \\(\\sqrt3r\\) なので、伝播時間は同じです。したがって到達時刻の差では伝播時間が消え、音源がCからBへ進む時間だけが残ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{3\\omega}+\\frac{\\sqrt3r}{V}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3\\omega}+\\frac{\\sqrt3r}{V}\\right)=\\frac{4\\pi}{3\\omega}\\,[\\mathrm{s}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　振動数 \\(f_0\\) が続けて聞こえる間隔",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "視線方向の速度成分が0になる点A・Dで出た音は \\(f_0\\) で聞こえます。AからPまでの距離は \\(r\\)、DからPまでは \\(3r\\) です。発音時刻の差に伝播時間の差を足します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\Delta t=\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}+\\frac{3r}{V}-\\frac{r}{V}=\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega}+\\frac{2r}{V}\\,[\\mathrm{s}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5)　観測振動数の時刻関数",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "点Pと音源Sの距離を \\(x\\)、角SPOを \\(\\theta\\) とおきます。視線方向速度を求めるため、円運動の速度 \\(r\\omega\\) をPS方向へ射影します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q1-projection-geometry",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x^2=r^2+(2r)^2-2\\cdot r\\cdot2r\\cos\\omega t=r^2(5-4\\cos\\omega t)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r\\omega\\sin(\\omega t+\\theta)=\\frac{2r\\omega\\sin\\omega t}{\\sqrt{5-4\\cos\\omega t}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "音源が点Pから遠ざかる向きを正に取ると、移動音源のドップラー効果の分母は \\(V+\\) 視線方向速度です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(t)=\\frac{V\\sqrt{5-4\\cos\\omega t}}{V\\sqrt{5-4\\cos\\omega t}+2r\\omega\\sin\\omega t}f_0\\,[\\mathrm{Hz}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "グラフは主要時刻での値を先に置き、それらを式の増減に合わせて滑らかにつなぎます。伝播時間が位置ごとに違うので、上下対称にはなりません。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q1-frequency-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(6)　超音速音源",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "音源の速さが音速を超えると、音源が波面より前へ進み、多くの波面が同位相で重なって圧力が急変する衝撃波が生じる。点Pには衝撃波とドップラー効果で振動数が変化した音が周期的に届く。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　接触する2物体の単振動（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "まずここを確認",
            "text": "接触中はAとBが同じ加速度で動きます。ただし離れる条件を出すには、2物体をまとめるだけでなく、接触力 \\(N\\) を含む個別の運動方程式が必要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　物体Aだけの周期",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m\\alpha=-kx\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　AとBが離れる条件",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "接触中の共通加速度を \\(\\beta\\)、AがBを押す力を \\(N\\) とすると、AとBの運動方程式は次の2本です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m\\beta=-kx-N,\\qquad m\\beta=N",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\beta=-\\frac{k}{2m}x,\\qquad N=-\\frac{k}{2}x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "物体Bは引っ張れないので、接触力が0になる \\(x=0\\) で離れます。接触中は角振動数 \\(\\sqrt{k/(2m)}\\) の単振動で、端から中心までの時間は周期の \\(1/4\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{2m}{k}},\\qquad v_A=v_B=a\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{2m}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　分離後の再衝突時刻と位置",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "分離後のAは角振動数 \\(\\sqrt{k/m}\\) の単振動です。中心で速度最大、端で速度0なので、再衝突までの時間は周期の \\(1/4\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Aの振幅を \\(A_0\\) とおき、中心での最大速度を分離時の速度と等しくします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A_0\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}=a\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{2m}}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=A_0=\\frac{a}{\\sqrt2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　壁の位置",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "壁を \\(x=L\\) とします。Bは速度の大きさを変えずに壁で向きだけ反転し、最後は \\(x=a/\\sqrt2\\) でAと衝突します。Bの経路長は \\(L+(L-a/\\sqrt2)\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}=\\frac{L+(L-a/\\sqrt2)}{a\\sqrt{k/(2m)}}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad L=\\frac{2+\\pi}{4\\sqrt2}a",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "つまずきやすい点",
            "text": "完全弾性衝突ではBの速さは変わらず、向きだけが逆になります。往路と復路を別々の距離として足してください。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　RLC直列交流回路（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "まずここを確認",
            "text": "抵抗の電圧を基準にすると、電流は同相、コイル電圧は \\(\\pi/2\\) 進み、コンデンサー電圧は \\(\\pi/2\\) 遅れます。まずこの3本を同じ時刻変数でそろえます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　角周波数",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\omega=\\frac{2\\pi}{T}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　電流の時刻関数と実効値",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "ab間は抵抗なので、電流と電圧は同相です。最大電流は \\(I_0=V_0/R\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "I(t)=\\frac{V_0}{R}\\sin\\omega t,\\qquad I_{\\mathrm e}=\\frac{V_0}{\\sqrt2R}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　コイル電圧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "v_1(t)=\\frac{\\omega LV_0}{R}\\cos\\omega t,\\qquad V_{1\\mathrm e}=\\frac{\\omega LV_0}{\\sqrt2R}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　コンデンサー電圧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "コンデンサーのリアクタンスは \\(1/(\\omega C)\\) で、電圧は電流より \\(\\pi/2\\) 遅れます。したがって余弦表示には負号が付きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "v_2(t)=-\\frac{V_0}{\\omega CR}\\cos\\omega t,\\qquad V_{2\\mathrm e}=\\frac{V_0}{\\sqrt2\\omega CR}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5)　コンデンサー電圧が0の時刻",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=\\frac{\\pi}{2\\omega},\\qquad\\frac{3\\pi}{2\\omega}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(6)　電源電圧の最大値",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "電源電圧は3素子の電圧の和です。正弦項と余弦項を分け、係数の二乗和の平方根を振幅とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V(t)=\\frac{V_0}{R}\\left\\{R\\sin\\omega t+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)\\cos\\omega t\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_3=\\frac{V_0}{R}\\sqrt{R^2+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)^2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(7)　bd間の電圧が常に0となる条件",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\omega_1L-\\frac{1}{\\omega_1C}=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\omega_1=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{LC}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(8)　平均消費電力",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "理想コイルとコンデンサーの平均消費電力は0です。抵抗だけを考え、\\(\\sin^2\\omega t\\) の1周期平均を \\(1/2\\) とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P(t)=\\frac{V_0^2}{R}\\sin^2\\omega t\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\overline P=\\frac{V_0^2}{2R}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-voltage-phasor",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問　薄膜による光の干渉（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "まずここを確認",
            "text": "反射する側の屈折率が高いと位相が \\(\\pi\\) だけ変化し、低いと変化しません。本問では上面反射だけが \\(\\pi\\) 変化します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　薄膜中の波長",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lambda_1=\\frac{\\lambda_0}{n_1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　垂直入射で強め合う膜厚",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2n_1d_k=\\left(k-\\frac12\\right)\\lambda_0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad d_k=\\frac{(k-1/2)\\lambda_0}{2n_1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　次に明るくなる波長",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "波長を短くすると薄膜内に入る波の数が増えます。一度暗くなった後の次の極大は次数が1つ進みます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lambda_2=\\frac{k-1/2}{k+1/2}\\lambda_0=\\frac{2k-1}{2k+1}\\lambda_0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　波長比から膜厚を数値計算",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "508=\\frac{2k-1}{2k+1}\\cdot600\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad k=6",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\cdot2.0\\cdot d_k=\\left(6-\\frac12\\right)600\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad d_k=8.3\\times10^2\\,[\\mathrm{nm}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5)　斜入射での反射位相",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\text{光線C}:0,\\qquad\\text{光線D}:\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(6)　斜入射で強め合う条件",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "斜入射では薄膜内の光路差が \\(2n_1d\\cos r\\) になります。位相反転を含めて強め合い条件を立て、最後に屈折の法則で \\(r\\) を \\(i\\) に置き換えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2n_1d\\cos r=\\left(m+\\frac12\\right)\\lambda_3,\\qquad\\sin i=n_1\\sin r",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2d\\sqrt{n_1^2-\\sin^2i}=\\left(m+\\frac12\\right)\\lambda_3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(7)　最小膜厚",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "膜厚を最小にするには \\(m=0\\) とします。与えられた屈折角をそのまま \\(\\cos60^\\circ\\) に入れます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\cdot1.5\\cdot d_{\\min}\\cos60^\\circ=\\frac12\\cdot560\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad d_{\\min}=1.9\\times10^2\\,[\\mathrm{nm}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "つまずきやすい点",
            "text": "整数 \\(m\\) は0から始まります。また、(6)では最終答案を屈折角 \\(r\\) ではなく、指定された入射角 \\(i\\) で表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-physics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "講評を学習計画へつなげる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "style": "facts",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "第1問",
                "text": "(4)までを先に確保し、式導出とグラフを含む(5)に時間をかけ過ぎない。超音速の(6)は独立知識問として拾う。"
              },
              {
                "label": "第2問",
                "text": "接触力が0になる離脱条件と、単振動の端・中心での速さを図に書く。"
              },
              {
                "label": "第3問",
                "text": "RLC直列回路の典型題。抵抗を基準に位相をそろえ、完答を目標にする。"
              },
              {
                "label": "第4問",
                "text": "反射位相と整数の始点を最初に固定し、最後に単位と有効数字を確認する。"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
